  "description": {
    "en": "The Tecnifibre T-FIGHT TOUR 26 2025 is a 26-inch junior performance racquet designed for competitive players aged approximately 10 to 12. It features a 100 sq.in head, 250 g unstrung weight, 330 mm balance and an open 16x17 string pattern, delivering an effective blend of power, control and spin. Its 100% graphite construction provides a premium feel, while the lightweight setup helps young players develop technique, racquet-head speed and confidence before transitioning to a full-size adult racquet.",

    "zh": "Tecnifibre T-FIGHT TOUR 26 2025 是一款面向约10至12岁竞技型青少年的26英寸高性能球拍。采用100平方英寸拍面、250克空拍重量、330毫米平衡点及16×17开放式线床，在力量、控制与旋转之间取得良好平衡。100%石墨结构提供更专业的击球反馈，而轻量化设计则有助于青少年球员学习完整动作、提升拍头速度，并顺利过渡到成人全尺寸球拍。"
  },

